### Pillow 13.0.0 license note (T012 legacy item, closed by T013)

The frozen plan (§10.2) called Pillow's licence "HPND/PIL License".
That is the OLD name for the same licence text (Pillow 9.x/10.x/11.x
LICENSE wording). Pillow 13.0.0's own shipped LICENSE file, line 10,
says: "Like PIL, Pillow is licensed under the open source MIT-CMU
License:", its installed METADATA `License-Expression` is `MIT-CMU`,
and the official 13.0.0 documentation says the same. The lock entry
`Pillow==13.0.0 — MIT-CMU` is therefore CORRECT for 13.0.0; no version
was changed. The frozen spec files were not touched for this — the
correction lives here and in `requirements.lock`'s header comment.

